From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] WebRTC: no NEON claims without the NEON sources on 32-bit ARM
 Windows (generated)

The GN-to-moz.build translation defines WEBRTC_HAS_NEON for every 32-bit
ARM target while only the Linux and Android blocks add the NEON sources;
on Windows the build compiled the dispatchers and none of the NEON code.

Generated -- tools/patch-libwebrtc-win-arm32-neon.py makes every change
here; on a newer Firefox, run it again rather than applying this patch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
